Package: qupflowR
Title: Protocol Foundations for Connecting R to 'QuPath'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
 role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides the R foundations for an interface between R and the
 'QuPath' 0.7.0 platform for digital pathology image analysis: classified
 error conditions with a bilingual message catalogue, canonical protocol
 'JSON' helpers, a 'JSON Schema' subset validator together with the
 versioned protocol schemas, and a hash-pinned execution boundary for
 trusted external methods. These components define how R will talk to a
 local 'Java' bridge (a 'QuPath' extension and a headless worker) over an
 authenticated loopback protocol; the bridge client, a 'Shiny' app and a
 workflow engine are planned and not part of this version.
License: GPL (>= 3)
